  "id": "3-4-methylenedioxyamphetamine",
  "term": "3,4-methylenedioxyamphetamine",
  "definition": "3,4-methylenedioxyamphetamine is an amphetamine-related hallucinogen that blocks the reuptake of catecholamine neurotransmitters. At high doses it can damage serotonin-producing neurons and has been used experimentally for that effect.",
